    "Second batch: the next 25 English review-required candidates checked against authenticated CardTrader Pokémon Singles in read-only workflow 37412387905 on 2026-10-06. Twenty expansion matches confirmed by matching card counts and exact or TCGdex-linked EX-prefixed English expansion names; nineteen corresponding German locale records share those TCGdex set IDs and use the same expansion IDs.",
    "Third batch: English review-required candidates 51–75 checked against the same authenticated read-only audit on 2026-10-06. Nineteen expansion matches confirmed by matching card counts and exact or clearly corresponding TCGdex-linked names; fourteen corresponding German locale records share those TCGdex set IDs and use the same expansion IDs.",
